          "start_codepoint": 0,
          "end_codepoint": 20,
          "quote": "三月戊子，遣右將軍到彥之北伐，水軍入河。"
        },
        "interpretation": "到彥之奉遣北伐。"
      },
      {
        "id": "c-songshu-005-wangyi-annals:p003:date",
        "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-005-wangyi-annals:p003",
