        "month_source": {
          "raw_path": "sources/songshu/song005-ws2370105.wikitext",
          "line": 112,
          "start_codepoint": 0,
          "end_codepoint": 3,
          "quote": "十一月"
        },
        "event_source": {
          "raw_path": "sources/songshu/song005-ws2370105.wikitext",
          "line": 112,
          "start_codepoint": 0,
          "end_codepoint": 43,
          "quote": "十一月癸未，虎牢城復為索虜所陷。壬辰，遣征南大將軍檀道濟北討，右將軍到彥之自滑臺奔退。"
        },
        "interpretation": "不同日各記虎牢陷、檀道濟北討及到彥之奔退。"
      },
      {
        "id": "c-songshu-005-wangyi-annals:p005:date",
